# Elysium testnet. Contract addresses come from the SDK's deployment record (packages/sdk/src/deployments.ts, written
# from CloakConfig's registry); the site ignores VITE_FACTORY, VITE_ROUTER and the like on public chains.
# The keeper: set VITE_KEEPER_URL and VITE_RELAYER_URL in the host's settings (https://keeper.boblabs.tech). Without them
# the site uses the SDK's record, which is the same address.
